   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dozens of counter-protesters from several right-wing groups organize a demonstration against the annual traditional LGBTQ CSD demonstration in Dortmund, Germany, on September 14, 2024. (Photo by Ying Tang/NurPhoto)</rdf:li>
